WEBVTT

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:15.549
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:20.354
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:24.491
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:37.638
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:46.046
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.113 --> 00:00:53.454
shining warmly.

00:00:53.454 --> 00:00:58.192
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.259 --> 00:01:05.132
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:15.343
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.343 --> 00:01:22.617
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.617 --> 00:01:27.422
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:34.362
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:42.036
Based on the manga by the beloved
Ikeda Riyoko

00:01:53.648 --> 00:01:55.049
Is that her?
<b> </b>
<b> </b>

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:55.583
Is that her?
Yeah.
<b> </b>

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:57.051
Is that her?
Yeah.
Misonoo Nanako!

00:01:57.051 --> 00:01:58.853
She looks so plain!
<b> </b>

00:01:58.853 --> 00:02:00.922
She looks so plain!
It's just not fair.

00:02:06.594 --> 00:02:07.528
Look!
<b> </b>

00:02:07.528 --> 00:02:08.529
Look!
She's so clumsy!

00:02:08.529 --> 00:02:12.600
The spectacular fall
of a sorority member!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.735
Serves her right!

00:02:17.138 --> 00:02:18.539
Nanako-san!

00:02:30.685 --> 00:02:32.087
Miya-sama...!

00:02:34.156 --> 00:02:35.624
Here...

00:02:36.558 --> 00:02:38.026
Here...

00:02:57.045 --> 00:02:58.980
Thank you very much...

00:03:00.849 --> 00:03:03.918
Don't become discouraged.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:12.794
Miya-sama is truly great.
Such majesty!

00:03:12.994 --> 00:03:16.197
Who were the ones
bad mouthing you?

00:03:16.665 --> 00:03:20.535
Say, Misonoo-san, what did
Miya-sama say just then?

00:03:20.535 --> 00:03:22.804
What? Nothing...

00:03:23.939 --> 00:03:29.544
6. Lost and Alone

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.352
Nanako, what time
was it on Sunday?

00:03:37.352 --> 00:03:38.019
What?
<b> </b>

00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:39.888
What?
You'll be baking a cake with Tomoko?

00:03:39.955 --> 00:03:42.624
Oh! That... well, we
may postpone it...

00:03:42.624 --> 00:03:45.227
But you were looking
forward to it so...

00:03:45.494 --> 00:03:51.033
There's an English quiz next week...
and we are both busy with our clubs...

00:03:57.105 --> 00:03:58.440
Thank you.

00:03:59.441 --> 00:04:00.909
Are you enjoying school?

00:04:00.909 --> 00:04:02.110
Of course!
<b> </b>

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.579
Of course!
I see.

00:04:04.046 --> 00:04:08.250
Our usually-talkative Nanako doesn't say
much about her school lately...

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.587
Don't worry! I'm enjoying it a lot.

00:04:11.587 --> 00:04:13.922
It's so different from Junior High.

00:04:17.926 --> 00:04:21.597
Don't worry! I'm enjoying it a lot.

00:04:21.597 --> 00:04:24.466
It's so different from Junior High.

00:04:25.934 --> 00:04:27.202
You're a liar!

00:04:33.275 --> 00:04:34.877
I hate it.

00:04:35.144 --> 00:04:37.279
I've been slandered by
people I don't even know.

00:04:38.013 --> 00:04:40.015
How can I say such a thing?

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:42.885
Really.

00:04:44.887 --> 00:04:47.089
Brother, dear brother..

00:04:47.289 --> 00:04:50.559
I cannot write a letter now.

00:04:51.761 --> 00:04:56.832
I wonder if I could possibly
meet you some day.

00:05:02.972 --> 00:05:05.241
We have to assemble at the
gymnasium because of the rain.

00:05:05.241 --> 00:05:08.110
I'd hoped the class was canceled.

00:05:08.578 --> 00:05:10.846
Instead there is
strength-testing today!

00:05:12.515 --> 00:05:14.250
So, let's go!

00:05:15.117 --> 00:05:16.252
What's the matter?
<b> </b>

00:05:16.252 --> 00:05:18.254
What's the matter?
My bag is gone.

00:05:18.254 --> 00:05:19.322
What?
<b> </b>

00:05:19.322 --> 00:05:21.591
What?
It has my gym clothes.

00:05:23.059 --> 00:05:25.194
I'm sure I left it here this morning.

00:05:29.065 --> 00:05:31.734
Hey, daughter of a rat dog!

00:05:31.734 --> 00:05:32.869
Shinobu-san...!

00:05:32.869 --> 00:05:35.672
What do you want,
pornographer's daughter!

00:05:35.672 --> 00:05:37.874
Hand back her gym bag!

00:05:38.741 --> 00:05:41.077
You must have hidden it!

00:05:41.077 --> 00:05:42.211
Don't... Mariko-san...

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.149
Stop with the nonsense.

00:05:46.616 --> 00:05:49.953
Why would I want
to do such a thing?

00:05:49.953 --> 00:05:53.156
Yes, you must have
left it somewhere.

00:05:53.556 --> 00:05:57.360
Right, you're getting absent-minded due
to being chosen as a Sorority member.

00:05:57.961 --> 00:05:59.028
Guess so!

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:00.964
Dear me!
<b> </b>

00:06:00.964 --> 00:06:02.432
Dear me!
For sure!

00:06:05.902 --> 00:06:07.170
Wait a minute!

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.506
Stop! Let them go.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.643
You can't accuse her.
There is no evidence.

00:06:13.643 --> 00:06:14.577
But..
<b> </b>

00:06:14.577 --> 00:06:16.713
But..
It's ok - I can borrow gym clothes
from a friend.

00:06:18.048 --> 00:06:20.984
A friend? Tomoko-san?

00:06:20.984 --> 00:06:22.186
Yes.

00:06:22.186 --> 00:06:24.721
So you can go on
ahead. To the gym.

00:06:26.056 --> 00:06:27.924
But will she lend you
her gym clothes?

00:06:28.859 --> 00:06:29.793
What?

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:35.332
She seems to be avoiding you lately.

00:06:39.202 --> 00:06:40.937
Did you two... have a quarrel?

00:06:42.272 --> 00:06:45.409
Don't worry! She'll help me out.

00:06:45.409 --> 00:06:46.343
Buy!

00:07:05.362 --> 00:07:06.363
Tomoko!

00:07:08.365 --> 00:07:11.368
Finally we can talk!
I've been worrying...

00:07:11.368 --> 00:07:15.906
When I called you last night. I
was told you were already asleep.

00:07:17.641 --> 00:07:18.776
What do you want?

00:07:19.176 --> 00:07:20.310
What?

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.446
Is there something
you want from me?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.852
I believe you called out to me.

00:07:28.852 --> 00:07:30.054
Ummm... I...

00:07:30.321 --> 00:07:33.390
I was wondering if I could
borrow your gym clothes.

00:07:34.058 --> 00:07:36.060
My gym clothes aren't good enough.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.996
They wouldn't be appropriate
for a sorority member.

00:07:48.005 --> 00:07:49.273
Tomoko...

00:07:49.607 --> 00:07:53.210
Since you are no longer
the Nanako I knew.

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:55.946
perhaps someone else could
loan you some gym clothes.

00:08:01.819 --> 00:08:03.087
Tomoko!

00:08:03.888 --> 00:08:05.089
Tomoko!

00:08:06.957 --> 00:08:08.025
Wait!

00:08:09.026 --> 00:08:10.161
Excuse me!

00:08:10.695 --> 00:08:12.430
Please sign this.
<b> </b>

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.698
Please sign this.
Please.

00:08:14.632 --> 00:08:15.900
What for?

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:21.906
To expel Miss Misonoo from the Sorority
due to her being chosen unfairly.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.575
Please sign here.

00:08:30.314 --> 00:08:32.183
Did you see her expression?

00:08:32.183 --> 00:08:35.386
Why couldn't she have signed it
herself? That would be great!

00:08:35.386 --> 00:08:36.587
For sure!

00:08:36.587 --> 00:08:38.122
Oh, hey... Arikura-san!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.859
Weren't you in junior high
school with Misonoo-san...?

00:08:41.859 --> 00:08:42.860
Umm... Yes...

00:08:43.328 --> 00:08:47.599
How did she get chosen? You
must know all her dirty tricks...?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.469
Come on, tell me.. please!

00:08:52.136 --> 00:08:52.937
She has none.
<b> </b>

00:08:52.937 --> 00:08:53.671
She has none.
What?

00:08:54.339 --> 00:08:56.140
None. Not at all.

00:08:56.541 --> 00:08:57.675
But...

00:08:57.876 --> 00:08:59.344
Absolutely NONE!

00:08:59.344 --> 00:09:02.881
I know Nanako and her family very
well! They don't use dirty tricks!

00:09:02.881 --> 00:09:03.815
Well I never!
<b> </b>

00:09:03.815 --> 00:09:06.217
Well I never!
You didn't have to make
such a fuss about it!

00:09:11.489 --> 00:09:13.825
What's happened to you, Tomoko!

00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:25.236
You hate me just because I was
chosen as a sorority member!?

00:09:25.904 --> 00:09:27.172
You fool!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.713
Good. Tomoko refused.
I knew she would.

00:09:36.114 --> 00:09:38.517
Misonoo-san! Misonoo-san!

00:09:38.717 --> 00:09:41.386
You couldn't get them?
Why? Why not?

00:09:42.187 --> 00:09:43.188
No...

00:09:43.188 --> 00:09:45.390
She didn't bring hers today.

00:09:46.057 --> 00:09:47.993
OK, then come on!

00:09:47.993 --> 00:09:50.462
I can borrow them from a
big sister for you. Let's go.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:52.998
Come on!

00:09:55.334 --> 00:09:56.268
What are you doing here?

00:09:56.535 --> 00:09:58.403
Class is starting!
<b> </b>

00:09:58.403 --> 00:09:59.204
Class is starting!
You see...

00:09:59.338 --> 00:10:01.940
...I've lost my gym clothes...

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:04.142
We are going to borrow some from...

00:10:04.343 --> 00:10:06.211
You can use mine.

00:10:06.211 --> 00:10:07.279
Oh!

00:10:07.279 --> 00:10:09.481
But what about you then?

00:10:09.948 --> 00:10:12.351
No problem, I'm leaving early today.

00:10:13.752 --> 00:10:18.957
I'm off to the hospital to have
some follow-up tests done.

00:10:19.158 --> 00:10:21.293
I may look healthy but
I'm still recovering.

00:10:22.761 --> 00:10:24.563
These might be big for you...

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.435
Thank you very much!
Thank you very much!

00:10:31.637 --> 00:10:32.638
Thank you...

00:10:33.238 --> 00:10:34.373
... so very much...

00:11:08.941 --> 00:11:12.278
They had a certain
sweet and clean smell...

00:11:12.478 --> 00:11:15.548
...with the crisp
touch of Biyakudan.

00:11:17.617 --> 00:11:21.153
I found myself entirely
encircled by Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:11:21.954 --> 00:11:28.761
All that morning, I felt I had the
ability to keep on going.

00:11:37.303 --> 00:11:39.439
In the afternoon,
the rain stopped,

00:11:39.972 --> 00:11:42.308
and my only remaining
class was English.

00:11:42.709 --> 00:11:47.780
I planned on going home early and
washing Kaoru-no-Kimi's gym clothes.

00:11:48.381 --> 00:11:50.650
I was feeling much better..

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:53.720
...and I started feeling
a little bit happier too.

00:11:54.254 --> 00:11:59.325
I decided to buy a
notebook before class.

00:12:01.327 --> 00:12:03.530
Here, twenty yen.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.398
Thanks.

00:12:14.674 --> 00:12:16.009
Just a second, Miss.

00:12:16.943 --> 00:12:19.412
Aren't you Miss Misonoo,
a freshmen, section B?

00:12:20.146 --> 00:12:21.081
Yes.

00:12:21.081 --> 00:12:23.216
We are sophomores.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.418
We'd like to speak to you a moment.

00:12:28.021 --> 00:12:30.090
I'm sorry, I should probably
get back right away.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.225
My class is about to start.

00:12:32.959 --> 00:12:38.365
Hold it! It would be wise to obey
us while we're still reasonable.

00:12:38.365 --> 00:12:39.232
What?!

00:12:39.499 --> 00:12:41.101
Get over here!

00:12:45.572 --> 00:12:47.240
This won't take long.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.044
Unless you don't pay
attention, that is!

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.783
Resign from the Sorority.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.719
Resign, of your own volition.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.925
You understand why, don't you...?

00:13:05.192 --> 00:13:08.328
You didn't even attend the party.

00:13:08.328 --> 00:13:10.597
You shouldn't have been chosen.

00:13:10.597 --> 00:13:13.133
We won't permit such an injustice.

00:13:13.867 --> 00:13:15.202
Injustice?!
<b> </b>

00:13:15.202 --> 00:13:16.470
Injustice?!
There is no injustice!

00:13:21.675 --> 00:13:23.544
If it's not an injustice, how
could it have happened?

00:13:24.211 --> 00:13:26.413
I don't know how it happened!

00:13:26.413 --> 00:13:27.614
Damn you!

00:13:30.284 --> 00:13:31.752
Take it easy! Hey!

00:13:34.621 --> 00:13:37.891
We, too, once were
candidates for the Sorority.

00:13:40.227 --> 00:13:43.631
We faced the selection
process fairly...

00:13:44.098 --> 00:13:45.165
...but were not chosen.

00:13:45.499 --> 00:13:46.700
But still...

00:13:46.967 --> 00:13:49.637
...still we have our pride!

00:13:51.505 --> 00:13:54.575
Follow your conscience.
Think on it.

00:14:08.723 --> 00:14:09.724
Brother...

00:14:10.591 --> 00:14:12.993
...Dear Brother, I...

00:14:14.328 --> 00:14:22.270
I looked into those eyes and saw hearts
filled with hatred and anger,

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:29.544
and despair, jealousy.. even sorrow,
such as I've never seen before.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:38.419
I fear that someday I
could become like her.

00:14:50.965 --> 00:14:54.235
You're kidding! Surely
you're not serious!

00:14:54.702 --> 00:14:56.170
I'm serious.

00:14:56.437 --> 00:14:58.840
But Nanako, that's crazy!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.376
You can't leave the
sorority! You can't!

00:15:01.376 --> 00:15:04.712
I've already made my decision.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:09.117
I will ask Miya-sama to let
me leave tomorrow morning.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.719
In the past, members
have been disowned,

00:15:11.719 --> 00:15:16.524
...but no one in their right
mind has left willingly!

00:15:16.524 --> 00:15:18.726
You absolutely can't!
Nanako-san!

00:15:20.795 --> 00:15:23.998
Here it is.
My sports bag.

00:15:39.214 --> 00:15:40.081
So cruel.

00:15:43.018 --> 00:15:43.885
I can't wait.
<b> </b>

00:15:43.885 --> 00:15:44.352
I can't wait.
What?

00:15:45.086 --> 00:15:47.889
I can't wait! I can't
wait till tomorrow!

00:15:50.425 --> 00:15:51.159
Nanako-san!

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:58.895
No!

00:17:00.829 --> 00:17:04.099
Leaving the sorority
is utterly unthinkable.

00:17:10.439 --> 00:17:14.777
If you quit, you would be giving
in to the rumors and slander.

00:17:23.185 --> 00:17:26.589
I will protect you from those people.

00:17:29.125 --> 00:17:31.861
I will always be happy to
extend my hand on your behalf.

00:17:36.065 --> 00:17:37.600
So, don't quit now.

00:17:41.737 --> 00:17:42.872
All right?

00:18:02.892 --> 00:18:05.561
Are you enjoying school?

00:18:09.566 --> 00:18:12.035
You plan to bake a
cake with Tomoko...

00:18:18.842 --> 00:18:19.976
What do you want?

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.244
What?

00:18:21.511 --> 00:18:23.713
Is there something
you want from me?

00:18:28.051 --> 00:18:29.986
I believe you called out to me.

00:18:30.587 --> 00:18:34.724
I was wondering if I could
borrow your gym clothes.

00:18:35.392 --> 00:18:37.327
My gym clothes aren't good enough.

00:18:37.327 --> 00:18:40.330
They wouldn't be appropriate
for a sorority member.

00:19:12.562 --> 00:19:14.698
I don't know how it happened!

00:19:14.698 --> 00:19:15.899
Damn you!

00:19:25.976 --> 00:19:29.179
Dad... Mom...

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:31.648
I don't like school at all.

00:19:36.653 --> 00:19:39.056
Hey, is this ok? Here?

00:19:39.456 --> 00:19:41.458
Yeah, I want to stop
at the bookstore.

00:19:42.192 --> 00:19:43.194
See you later...
<b> </b>

00:19:43.194 --> 00:19:44.462
See you later...
Sure, later...

00:20:12.623 --> 00:20:13.958
I'll take these.

00:20:14.225 --> 00:20:15.760
Thank you!

00:20:33.644 --> 00:20:35.112
I can't endure this anymore.

00:20:53.931 --> 00:20:55.133
So, did you like it?

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.335
The music box?

00:20:57.869 --> 00:20:58.669
No!

00:20:59.804 --> 00:21:01.005
It's not...!

00:21:01.939 --> 00:21:03.141
It can't be!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.412
It just can't be true.

00:21:08.413 --> 00:21:09.681
What's so unbelievable?

00:21:10.415 --> 00:21:15.620
I... I was just thinking how
I wished I could see you...

00:21:18.089 --> 00:21:20.225
Well then! Perhaps
it isn't true after all.

00:21:24.762 --> 00:21:26.831
So what are you doing, out so late?

00:21:26.831 --> 00:21:29.634
Oh! Well... ummm...

00:21:31.369 --> 00:21:32.570
Never mind then.

00:21:32.971 --> 00:21:35.173
Eventually you'll tell me in a letter...

00:21:38.243 --> 00:21:39.377
Yes, I will!

00:21:44.916 --> 00:21:46.184
Oh, good.

00:21:46.785 --> 00:21:48.053
What?

00:21:48.853 --> 00:21:49.721
Never mind...

00:21:50.188 --> 00:21:51.923
Anyway, I'll send you home now.

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:55.260
It's rather late for a high
school student to be out alone.

00:21:56.261 --> 00:21:57.996
Great! Please do!

00:21:58.129 --> 00:21:59.931
So what about tomorrow
and the day after?

00:21:59.931 --> 00:22:01.132
Well, well...

00:22:02.267 --> 00:22:03.668
Sorry...!

00:22:17.282 --> 00:22:19.751
Brother, I am fine.

00:22:22.955 --> 00:22:25.824
No one hurts me.

00:22:26.625 --> 00:22:30.562
No one hates me, or
slanders me, or scoffs at me.

00:22:31.163 --> 00:22:34.433
I don't hate anybody.

00:22:36.301 --> 00:22:46.044
I am neither angry, nor jealous,
nor crying over being slandered.

00:22:46.445 --> 00:22:53.252
Nothing like that. My life
is peaceful and happy.

00:22:54.520 --> 00:23:01.994
If somehow you saw me crying, it must
have been over something minor.

00:23:03.796 --> 00:23:06.665
Anyway, I have been quite fine.

00:23:07.533 --> 00:23:09.735
Because, whatever happens,

00:23:11.337 --> 00:23:14.406
I still have my brother...

00:23:16.342 --> 00:23:21.347
And also Tomoko... so
I can't be unhappy.

00:23:26.285 --> 00:23:29.088
Tomoko, my friend
since childhood...

00:23:31.891 --> 00:23:34.360
Tomoko!

00:24:09.996 --> 00:24:14.200
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:19.672
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:25.278
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.278 --> 00:24:30.750
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.484 --> 00:24:37.023
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.023 --> 00:24:42.496
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.496 --> 00:24:45.232
This is surely a game

00:24:45.232 --> 00:24:48.034
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.034 --> 00:24:50.436
Always dancing,

00:24:50.436 --> 00:24:55.708
Always capricious...

00:25:03.583 --> 00:25:09.322
Nanako flees to the clock tower,
trying to escape her tormentors...

00:25:09.322 --> 00:25:15.796
...only to find it already occupied by
Saint-Juste, and her mysterious smile.

00:25:15.796 --> 00:25:19.466
Then Nanako sees that Saint-Juste is
holding a handful of sharp knives...!

00:25:20.133 --> 00:25:21.401
Next episode:
<b> </b>

00:25:21.401 --> 00:25:23.270
Next episode:
The Darkness in the Clock Tower

00:25:23.337 --> 00:25:24.872
Brother, Dear Brother...
<b> </b>

00:25:24.872 --> 00:25:28.275
Brother, Dear Brother...
There is no end to my tears...
